and sent it to your attorney.

16:48.585 --> 16:49.585
Really?

16:49.586 --> 16:52.019
Thank you. I-I owe you.

16:52.021 --> 16:53.387
You owe me nothing.

16:53.389 --> 16:55.423
I mean, other than two dollars
for the envelope

16:55.425 --> 16:57.825
and $1.75 for postage.

16:57.827 --> 16:59.393
