16:59.395 --> 17:01.596
No, I just filled up.

17:06.503 --> 17:09.103
Will you still be my husband?

17:09.105 --> 17:11.372
You know I can't quit you.

17:11.374 --> 17:12.673
Listen, I-I know
this isn't the wedding

17:12.675 --> 17:14.008
that you've always dreamed of,

17:14.010 --> 17:16.844
but I-I got a little surprise
for you for the ceremony.

17:16.846 --> 17:20.248
Tell me Vera Wang
started making tuxes.

17:20.250 --> 17:21.616
Even better.

17:21.618 --> 17:25.953
♪ When a man loves another man ♪

17:27.323 --> 17:29.457
♪ Can't keep his mind
on nothing else... ♪

17:29.459 --> 17:33.060
Oh... my... God.

17:33.062 --> 17:35.129
It's like you live
inside my dreams.

17:35.131 --> 17:37.865
Happy wife, happy life.

17:37.867 --> 17:39.834
Uh, fellas, can
we get this going?

17:39.836 --> 17:42.036
There's a lot of gay couples
here who'd like to get married

17:42.038 --> 17:44.405
