to a year hidden in my purse.

17:49.078 --> 17:52.380
♪ When a man loves
another man ♪

17:52.382 --> 17:54.048
Kill it, Bolton.

17:56.920 --> 17:58.719
Hello, Michael.

17:58.721 --> 18:00.955
