of pens into my mouth.

18:15.638 --> 18:17.338
We're here
to join Walden Schmidt

18:17.340 --> 18:19.974
and Alan Harper
in legal marriage.

18:19.976 --> 18:21.943
Have you two written
your own vows?

18:21.945 --> 18:23.311
No, the, uh, standard...
the standard

18:23.313 --> 18:25.880
“for richer, for poorer”
actually fits us quite well.

18:25.882 --> 18:26.914
Actually,

18:26.916 --> 18:29.350
I've written
a little something down.

18:29.352 --> 18:31.085
What? You didn't.

18:31.087 --> 18:32.320
