18:32.322 --> 18:34.288
Vows and Bolton?

18:34.290 --> 18:35.590
♪ When a man... ♪

18:35.592 --> 18:37.258
Not the cue, Bolton.

18:40.296 --> 18:41.762
Today,

18:41.764 --> 18:43.598
I'm marrying
my best friend.

18:43.600 --> 18:45.266
Do not cry.

18:45.268 --> 18:48.169
Keep it together, Alan.

18:48.171 --> 18:51.172
In the last four years,
I've been through a lot.

18:51.174 --> 18:55.376
Uh, there's been good times
and bad times.

18:55.378 --> 18:58.879
But through it all,
you were there.

18:58.881 --> 19:02.850
And I can't imagine
a future without you.

19:04.454 --> 19:07.655
