to say is...

19:07.657 --> 19:09.256
I love you.

19:09.258 --> 19:11.125
I love you, too.

19:14.130 --> 19:19.033
This is the gayest wedding
I've ever been to.

19:19.035 --> 19:21.068
I think it's beaut...
Wh-Whose hand is on my ass?

19:21.070 --> 19:23.304
Sorry.
Sorry.

19:23.306 --> 19:25.172
Walden,

19:25.174 --> 19:28.376
do you take Alan to be
your lawfully wedded husband?

19:29.212 --> 19:31.312
I do.

19:31.314 --> 19:33.981
And, Alan, do you take Walden
to be your...

19:33.983 --> 19:35.349
Try and stop me.

19:35.351 --> 19:37.985
I now
pronounce you married.

19:39.722 --> 19:40.655
You may kiss.

19:40.657 --> 19:41.956
Oh. Oh, yeah.

19:41.958 --> 19:44.458
Um, kiss. Right.

19:44.460 --> 19:45.693
Let's...

19:45.695 --> 19:46.994
Aw, what the hell.

19:51.434 --> 19:56.237
♪ When a man loves
another man... ♪

20:02.626 --> 20:04.359
♪&lt;i> Men.&lt;/i> ♪
Morning.

20:04.361 --> 20:08.897
