20:16.373 --> 20:17.973
You're the only guy I know

20:17.975 --> 20:21.710
that would register
for lotion and tissues.

20:21.712 --> 20:24.212
That was some party
last night, huh?

20:24.214 --> 20:27.115
Yeah, it must have been.
