a little fuzzy for me, too.

20:36.493 --> 20:38.693
The last thing I remember
is you doing body shots

20:38.695 --> 20:41.496
off of Michael Bolton.

20:41.498 --> 20:44.900
All of us did body shots
off of Michael Bolton.

20:51.040 --> 20:52.374
Even our moms got along.

20:52.376 --> 20:54.209
I wasn't sure they'd
click at first, but...

20:54.211 --> 20:56.211
